  "fixtureNotes": [
    "This fixture validates Chronicle transaction semantics rather than additional Werewolf mechanics.",
    "Every failure injected before commit must restore the complete pre-operation state.",
    "The success result becomes reusable only after its idempotency record is committed atomically with Character completion.",
    "Events are appended inside the transaction and become publishable only after commit.",
    "Stable timestamps, transaction IDs, snapshot IDs, event IDs, and fingerprints must be generated by the test builder.",
    "Chronicle owns transactionality, persistence, idempotency, snapshot storage, event publication, and recovery.",
    "The Rule Set owns final mechanical validation and completion-readiness semantics."
  ]
